6. OFAC AKA_WEAK hits, offshore secrecy hubs, FATF Black/Grey, or inconsistent wealth -> REVIEW.
7. Once done, output strict JSON: {"verdict": "APPROVE"|"REVIEW"|"DENY", "reason": "...", "cited_tools": [...]}.

